# Terraform state (may contain secrets) — never commit.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — the provider lock
# file is committed so the realm is reproducible on a fresh cluster (spec
# acceptance criterion 5). It contains only provider hashes, no secrets.

# Real variable files hold secrets — never commit; the .example is allowed.
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
